\ REGISTERS is a host-owned buffer, authorized before this setup runs.
REGISTERS 256 MMIO_READ MMIO_WRITE OR MMIO_WIDTH_8 MMIO-REGISTER DROP
CREATE BUFFER 256 ALLOT
BUFFER 256 90 FILL
: LEAF BUFFER REGISTERS 256 1 TRUE DICT>MMIO
       REGISTERS BUFFER 256 1 TRUE MMIO>DICT ;
